  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73eee14a7e877354f8371fe457eb406d, type: 3}
  m_Name: BackgroundCheckIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speaker: Boss
    text: Now I need you to do some background checks. When you read a CV, there
      will be a code on there. Memorize it.
  - speaker: Boss
    text: 'Then click on the ''Browser'' on the computer and type in the code to
      check their criminal record. '
  - speaker: Boss
    text: 'Make sure you check everyone for this, we don''t want you hiring someone
      that might use their new position to commit crimes! '
